fact:
According to the paper "Direct Preference Optimization: Your Language Model is Secretly a Reward Model", the reward function selected by the DPO reparameterization satisfies \begin{equation}\label{eq:lag_p}
     \sum_{y}\underbrace{\pi_\text{ref}(y\mid x)\exp\left(\frac{1}{\beta}r(x, y)\right)}_{=\pi(y\mid x)\text{, using Thm.~\ref{thm:main} reparam.}} = 1,
\end{equation}
